{TEXT 319 5 "Hints" }{TEXT 324 1 ":" }{TEXT 320 1 " " }{TEXT 324 10 " \+
Note that" }{TEXT 321 20 " convert(x,base,10) " }{TEXT 324 139 "will g
ive you the decimal digits of x in a list. It should help if you first
